{"meta":{"id":"scope","category":"it/syntax/jsp/el","title":"EL 값 꺼내기 (범위 · param · cookie) · JSP","subtitle":"(JSP · JSTL · EL)","summary":"${이름} 범위 탐색 순서, requestScope · sessionScope, param, cookie.이름.value","tags":["jsp","f-web-scope"],"color":"indigo","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-indigo","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-indigo-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-indigo-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-indigo-50 text-indigo-700 border border-indigo-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></span>JSP · JSTL · EL</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">EL 값 꺼내기 (범위 · param · cookie) · JSP</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-indigo-50/70 border border-indigo-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-indigo-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> ${이름} 범위 탐색 순서, requestScope · sessionScope, param, cookie.이름.value</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">값 꺼내기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">jsp</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">${name}                 &lt;!-- page → request → session → application 순서로 찾음 --&gt;\r\n${requestScope.name}    ${sessionScope.sMid}    ${applicationScope.count}   &lt;!-- 범위 지정 --&gt;\r\n${vo.name}              &lt;!-- getter 호출 (getName()) --&gt;\r\n${param.mid}            &lt;!-- request.getParameter(&quot;mid&quot;) --&gt;\r\n${paramValues.hobby[0]}\r\n${cookie.aMidA.value}   &lt;!-- 쿠키 값 --&gt;</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">같은 이름이 여러 범위에 있으면 <strong>좁은 범위부터</strong> 찾는다: page &lt; request &lt; session &lt; application</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-indigo-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">Spring 의 model.addAttribute(\"키\", 값) 은 request 범위 → ${키}</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> Java › 데이터 전달 (request · session · cookie), Spring › Lombok (EL 대문자 주의)</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/jsp/el/scope","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"jsp","title":"JSP · JSTL · EL","path":"it/syntax/jsp"},{"id":"el","title":"EL 표현식","path":"it/syntax/jsp/el"}],"hasImage":false}